Commands: Delays in clock/4 (15 MHz)
DELAY  := 1101DDDD 0DDDDDDD 0DDDDDDD 0DDDDDDD  25 bit delay
OUTPUT := 1100DDDD 0DDDDDDD 0DDDDDDV 0VVVVVVV  8 bit output, 17 bit delay
ADC    := 10SSSXXX 0XXXXXXX 0XXYYYYY 0YYYYYYY


Responses: Delays in clock (60 MHz)
CAPTURE := 110DDDDD 0DDDDDDD 0DDDDVVV 0VVVVVVV 0VVVVVVV 0VVVVVVV
STATUS  := 1010____
